														Greetings,<br />
<br />
My name is Melana Oakenpride.  I am a level 49 Wizard.  Recently I had the pleasure of meeting Hammis, and we spent a very nice time together.  I am currently looking at joining a guild, and he thought that Questors might the right place for me.  I was hoping I might get a chance to raid with you, to get to know people, and allow you to get to know me.<br />
<br />
Here is a little background about myself.  I was once the Guild Counselor of Keepers of the Realm, as well as serving as leader at times.  However, we disbanded when Dark Age of Camelot was released.  Now I have recently returned after being gone from the game for about four months.  I miss belonging to a guild and have a “family” to belong to.<br />
<br />
I hope to meet others in your guild and talk with you.  If you see me online please give me a tell.  My email address is miholmes@esc.cr.k12.ia.us  I look forward to speaking with you.<br />
<br />
~Melana						</td>
